WEBVTT

00:15:29.636 --> 00:15:33.196
when I started really reaching
some heights in my career.

00:15:33.236 --> 00:15:36.036
And in the middle of all of that success,

00:15:36.076 --> 00:15:38.556
there was the sense
that something was missing.

00:15:38.596 --> 00:15:43.516
For me, a lot of the work and the pivot
came in taking a step back

00:15:43.556 --> 00:15:46.476
and going on this healing journey

00:15:46.516 --> 00:15:51.876
of reclaiming the intrinsic
pride and belonging

00:15:51.876 --> 00:15:56.436
and sense of self-worth
that didn't come from being productive

00:15:56.436 --> 00:16:00.236
or achieving my professional goals.